\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\lang1040\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. BREAD of heaven, on Thee I feed,
\par For Thy flesh is meat indeed :
\par Ever may my soul be fed 
\par With this true and living bread;
\par Day by day with strength supplied
\par Through the life of Him who died.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Vine of heaven, Thy blood supplies
\par This blest cup of sacrifice:
\par Tis Thy wounds my healing give;
\par To Thy cross I look and live:
\par Thou my life O let it be
\par Rooted, grafted, built on Thee! 
\par                                        Amen.
\par \lang1033\f1 
\par \cf1\lang1040\ul\b\f2\fs16 
\par }

